0,Comments=SLOT designation :\
"1v1"    : "Just the two of us"  areas (two + helli available).\
"2v2"    : AI will fill empty slots for a balaned 2 versus 2.\
"GUNS" : Guns only area'\
"AIR"     : Short range IR and guns.\
"WW2" : Older planes - Guns only\
\
1 autorespawn RED fighter.\
AIR:: Planes spawn airborn with short Range IR and Guns.\
Feel free to land and rearm with long range weapons but keep it to a sporty level.\
You can spawn extra AI units from the F10 radio menu. Do not abuse (especially with populated server).\
GUNS:: Seperate area with Guns-only planes for hardcore pilots. You can also spawn 2 AI RED M2000C from the F10 radio menu. \
ZZ:: slots are temporary - fun - tests. Feel free to explore.\
\
VR Friendly : Labels are automatically set to dots.\
Teamspeak : 94.130.23.93 Pass: JDF
